## 📘 41-DARS: I — MEN

**🤖 TalkMe:** Salom yana! Bugun **olmoshlar**ni boshlaymiz. **Olmosh nima?** Olmosh — bu **otning o‘rnida** ishlatiladigan so‘z. “Ali keladi” o‘rniga “**U** keladi” desak — “u” olmosh. Ingliz tilida **birinchi** olmosh: **I** — “men”. 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **I** [ay] — “men”. Bu — **birinchi shaxs birlik**. **Muhim:** **I** har doim **bosh harf** bilan yoziladi! “**I** am a student” — “**I**” katta harf. **Qanday ishlatamiz?** **I** am a student. **I** have a book. **I** like tea. **Muhim:** “I” dan keyin fe’l **am** (to be bilan) yoki **asosiy shakl** (boshqa fe’llar bilan): **I am** a student. **I have** a book. **I like** tea.

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> **I** am Ali. — Men Aliman.
> **I** am from Tashkent. — Men Toshkentdanman.
> **I** have two books. — Menda ikkita kitob bor.
> **I** like apples. — Men olmalarni yaxshi ko‘raman.
> **I** live in Uzbekistan. — Men O‘zbekistonda yashayman.

**✍️ MASHQ:**
1. “Men talabaman” → **✅ I am a student.**
2. “Menda kitob bor” → **✅ I have a book.**
3. “I” qanday yoziladi? a) i b) I → **✅ b) I** (bosh harf!)
4. Ovoz chiqarib: “I am a student. I have a book. I like tea.”

**✅ XULOSA:** **I** — “men”. Birinchi shaxs birlik. **I** har doim **bosh harf** bilan yoziladi. Qanday ishlatamiz: I am... / I have... / I like... Uyga vazifa: 3 ta gap tuzing: “I am...”, “I have...”, “I like...”.

**🤖 TalkMe yakuniy:** Ajoyib! Endi siz “men” deb aytasiz! Ertaga: **You** — “sen/siz”. 👋

