## 📘 48-DARS: EGALIK — MY, YOUR

**🤖 TalkMe:** Bugun **egalik olmoshlari**ni boshlaymiz: **my** (mening) va **your** (sening/sizning)! 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **My** [may] — “mening”. **Your** [yo] — “sening/sizning”. **Qanday ishlatamiz?** Egalik olmoshi **otdan oldin** keladi: **my** book (mening kitobim), **your** book (sening kitobing). **Muhim:** Egalik olmoshidan keyin ot **artikl olmaydi**: ✅ **my** book (not: my a book, not: my the book).

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> **My** book is on the table. — Mening kitobim stolda.
> **Your** pen is red. — Sening ruchkang qizil.
> **My** name is Ali. — Mening ismim Ali.
> **Your** name is Mary. — Sening isming Meri.
> **My** car is new. — Mening mashinam yangi.
> **Your** house is big. — Sening uying katta.

**✍️ MASHQ:**
1. “Mening kitobim” → **✅ my book**
2. “Sening ruchkang” → **✅ your pen**
3. “Mening ismim Ali” → **✅ My name is Ali.**
4. To‘g‘ri shaklni tanlang: “___ book is new.” a) my b) my a → **✅ a) my**
5. Ovoz chiqarib: “My book. Your pen. My name. Your name.”

**✅ XULOSA:** **My** — mening. **Your** — sening/sizning. Otdan oldin. Artikl yo‘q. Uyga vazifa: 3 ta gap tuzing: “My...”, “Your...”.

**🤖 TalkMe yakuniy:** Zo‘r! Endi siz “mening” va “sening” deb aytasiz! Ertaga: **his, her, our, their**. 👋

