**🤖 TalkMe:** Bugun qolgan **egalik olmoshlari**ni o‘rganamiz: **his, her, our, their**! 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **His** [hiz] — “uning” (erkak). **Her** [hyo] — “uning” (ayol). **Our** [aua] — “bizning”. **Their** [thea] — “ularning”. **Qanday ishlatamiz?** Otdan oldin: **his** book, **her** book, **our** book, **their** book. **Muhim:** Artikl yo‘q: ✅ **his** book (not: his a book).

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> **His** book is on the table. — Uning (erkak) kitobi stolda.
> **Her** pen is red. — Uning (ayol) ruchkasi qizil.
> **Our** house is big. — Bizning uyimiz katta.
> **Their** car is new. — Ularning mashinasi yangi.
> **His** name is Ali. — Uning ismi Ali.
> **Her** name is Mary. — Uning ismi Meri.

