1. “Uning (erkak) kitobi” → **✅ his book**
2. “Uning (ayol) ruchkasi” → **✅ her pen**
3. “Bizning uyimiz” → **✅ our house**
4. “Ularning mashinasi” → **✅ their car**
5. Ovoz chiqarib: “His book. Her pen. Our house. Their car.”

**✅ XULOSA:** **His** — uning (erkak). **Her** — uning (ayol). **Our** — bizning. **Their** — ularning. Otdan oldin. Artikl yo‘q. Uyga vazifa: 4 ta gap tuzing: “His...”, “Her...”, “Our...”, “Their...”.

