## 📘 50-DARS: KO‘RSATISH — THIS, THAT, THESE, THOSE + TAKRORLASH

**🤖 TalkMe:** Bugun **ko‘rsatish olmoshlari**ni o‘rganamiz: **this, that, these, those**! Va hammasini takrorlaymiz! 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **This** [zis] — “bu” (birlik, yaqin). **That** [zat] — “u” (birlik, uzoq). **These** [ziz] — “bular” (ko‘plik, yaqin). **Those** [zouz] — “ular” (ko‘plik, uzoq). **Qanday ishlatamiz?** **This** book — bu kitob. **That** book — u kitob. **These** books — bular kitoblar. **Those** books — ular kitoblar. **Muhim:** This/that + **birlik** ot. These/those + **ko‘plik** ot.

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> **This** book is mine. — Bu kitob meniki.
> **That** house is old. — U uy qari.
> **These** books are new. — Bular kitoblar yangi.
> **Those** houses are old. — Ular uylar qari.
> **This** is my pen. — Bu mening ruchkam.
> **These** are my books. — Bular mening kitoblarim.

**✍️ MASHQ:**
1. “Bu kitob” → **✅ this book**
2. “U uy” → **✅ that house**
3. “Bular kitoblar” → **✅ these books**
4. “Ular uylar” → **✅ those houses**
5. To‘g‘ri shaklni tanlang: “___ books are new.” a) this b) these → **✅ b) these**
6. **A1 Olmoshlarni takrorlang:** I, you, he, she, it, we, they, my, your, his, her, our, their, this, that, these, those.

**✅ XULOSA:** This (bu, birlik), that (u, birlik), these (bular, ko‘plik), those (ular, ko‘plik). **A1 Olmoshlar tugadi!** Uyga vazifa: 4 ta gap tuzing: “This...”, “That...”, “These...”, “Those...”.

**🤖 TalkMe yakuniy:** MUKAMMAL! Siz barcha **A1 olmoshlar**ni o‘zlashtirdingiz! Ertaga: **ravishlar** — here, there. 👋

