## 📘 51-DARS: HERE — BU YERDA

**🤖 TalkMe:** Endi **ravishlar**ni boshlaymiz! **Ravish nima?** Ravish — bu **ish-harakatning qanday, qayerda, qachon** sodir bo‘lishini bildiruvchi so‘z. Birinchi ravish: **here** — “bu yerda”. 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **Here** [hiya] — “bu yerda” / “bu yoqqa”. **O‘rin ravishi**. **Qanday ishlatamiz?** Odatda **fe’ldan keyin** keladi: Come **here**. (Bu yoqqa kel.) My book is **here**. (Mening kitobim bu yerda.) **Muhim:** “Here” — **gapiruvchining yaqinidagi** joyni bildiradi.

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> Come **here**. — Bu yoqqa kel.
> My book is **here**. — Mening kitobim bu yerda.
> Sit **here**, please. — Bu yerga o‘tiring, iltimos.
> **Here** is your pen. — Mana ruchkangiz.
> I am **here**. — Men bu yerdaman.

**✍️ MASHQ:**
1. “Bu yoqqa kel” → **✅ Come here.**
2. “Mening kitobim bu yerda” → **✅ My book is here.**
3. “Bu yerga o‘tiring” → **✅ Sit here.**
4. Ovoz chiqarib: “Come here. My book is here. I am here.”

**✅ XULOSA:** **Here** — “bu yerda” / “bu yoqqa”. O‘rin ravishi. Fe’ldan keyin. Uyga vazifa: 3 ta gap tuzing: “Come here.”, “My ... is here.”, “I am here.”.

**🤖 TalkMe yakuniy:** Zo‘r! Endi siz “bu yerda” deb aytasiz! Ertaga: **there** — “u yerda”. 👋

