## 📘 60-DARS: USUALLY — ODATDA + TAKRORLASH

**🤖 TalkMe:** Bugun **usually** — “odatda” ni o‘rganamiz va **hammasini takrorlaymiz**! 🚀

**📖 QOIDA:** **Usually** [yujuali] — “odatda”. **Chastota ravishi**. **Qanday ishlatamiz?** Odatda **fe’ldan oldin** keladi: I **usually** get up at 7. (Men odatda soat 7 da turaman.) **To be dan keyin:** He is **usually** busy. **Chastota ravishlari tartibi (ko‘pdan kamga):** always (100%) → usually (90%) → often (70%) → sometimes (50%) → seldom (30%) → never (0%).

**💬 MISOLLAR:**
> I **usually** get up at 7 o’clock. — Men odatda soat 7 da turaman.
> He **usually** goes to work by bus. — U odatda ishga avtobusda boradi.
> She **usually** cooks dinner. — U odatda kechki ovqat qiladi.
> He is **usually** busy. — U odatda band bo‘ladi. (to be dan keyin)
> They **usually** play football on Sundays. — Ular odatda yakshanba kunlari futbol o‘ynashadi.

**✍️ MASHQ:**
1. “Men odatda soat 7 da turaman” → **✅ I usually get up at 7 o’clock.**
2. “U odatda ishga avtobusda boradi” → **✅ He usually goes to work by bus.**
3. “U odatda band bo‘ladi” → **✅ He is usually busy.**
4. **A1 Ravishlarni takrorlang:** here, there, inside, outside, now, yesterday, tomorrow, always, never, often, usually.
5. Ovoz chiqarib: “I usually get up at 7. He usually goes to work by bus.”

**✅ XULOSA:** **Usually** — “odatda”. Fe’ldan oldin. To be dan keyin. Chastota tartibi: always → usually → often → sometimes → seldom → never. **A1 Ravishlar tugadi!** Uyga vazifa: 5 ta gap tuzing — 5 ta ravish bilan: here, now, always, never, usually.

